# Project rules

Read `AGENTS.md` first for stack, folders, auth, and env conventions.

- Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind brand tokens, `en`/`ja` locales
- Double quotes; match neighboring file style; no drive-by refactors
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when needed
- Persistent data → Supabase migrations + RLS; use `@/lib/supabase/*` clients
- Authorize on the server (`getUser` / `getClaims` + `profiles.role`); never trust the client for roles
- UI: cream/ink/orange, `btn-primary` / `container-page`, lucide icons only
